<h2>{{ title }}</h2>

<p>
  sometimes i write out guitar tabs for songs that i love but don’t have many/any. it’s been great practice for my ears
  and also weirdly fun and almost meditative? i figure them out by ear, close investigative examinations of live videos
  (if i can find any), or sometimes dissecting them within a
  <abbr title="digital audio workstation">DAW</abbr> by using EQ and isolating channels, et cetera.
</p>

<p>
  i’ve been posting them on
  <a rel="external" href="https://www.ultimate-guitar.com/u/dstbnnyjp">Ultimate Guitar Tabs</a>
  but i figured i might as well put them here too! you can click on a link to view it or right-click and “save link as…”
  to download the text file on your own device!
</p>

<p>
  and yes, i <em>do</em> like <a rel="external" href="https://weatherornot.bandcamp.com/">Weatherday</a> a <em>lot</em>,
  lmao.
</p>

